  "type": "oauth2",
  "flows": {
    "password": {
      "scopes": {
        "scope2": "description2"
      },
      "tokenUrl": "/token"
    }
  }
}
```

We should merge them into:
```json
{
  "type": "oauth2",
  "flows": {
    "password": {
      "scopes": {
        "scope1": "description1",
        "scope2": "description2"
      },
      "tokenUrl": "/token"
    }
